:1905249480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc5xj8zI","user":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-23T03:55:28Z","updated_at":"2024-01-23T03:55:28Z","body":"Smaller repro:\r\n\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# explain SELECT count(*) FROM pg_type WHERE oid = 21 AND oid < 0;\r\n                                      QUERY PLAN                                       \r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Finalize Aggregate  (cost=4.12..4.13 rows=1 width=8)\r\n   ->  Index Scan using pg_type_oid_index on pg_type  (cost=0.00..4.12 rows=1 width=0)\r\n         Index Cond: ((oid < '0'::oid) AND (oid = '21'::oid))\r\n         Partial Aggregate: true\r\n(4 rows)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# SELECT count(*) FROM pg_type WHERE oid = 21 AND oid < 0;\r\n count \r\n-------\r\n     1\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt looks like translation of ybIsTupMismatch conditions was not done properly.  Incomplete fix:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git i/src/postgres/src/backend/access/yb_access/yb_scan.c w/src/postgres/src/backend/access/yb_access/yb_scan.c\r\nindex b6312e6b3bf..71edc44a7b7 100644\r\n--- i/src/postgres/src/backend/access/yb_access/yb_scan.c\r\n+++ w/src/postgres/src/backend/access/yb_access/yb_scan.c\r\n@@ -2093,7 +2093,8 @@ YbGetOrdinaryColumnsNeedingRecheck(YbScanDesc ybScan)\r\n     {\r\n         if (ybScan->prepare_params.index_only_scan ||\r\n             (ybScan->target_key_attnums[i] != InvalidAttrNumber &&\r\n-             keys[i]->sk_flags & ~(SK_SEARCHNULL | SK_SEARCHNOTNULL)))\r\n+             (!keys[i]->sk_flags ||\r\n+              (keys[i]->sk_flags & (SK_SEARCHNULL | SK_SEARCHNOTNULL)))))\r\n         {\r\n             int bms_idx = YBAttnumToBmsIndexWithMinAttr(\r\n                 YBFirstLowInvalidAttributeNumber, keys[i]->sk_attno);\r\n@@ -2790,8 +2791,6 @@ ybc_systable_getnext(YbSysScanBase default_scan)\r\n     HeapTuple tuple = ybc_getnext_heaptuple(\r\n         scan->ybscan, true /* is_forward_scan */, &recheck);\r\n \r\n-    Assert(!recheck);\r\n-\r\n     return tuple;\r\n }\r\n \r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice the second hunk is needed for initdb to work, but the recheck should actually done.  Hopefully, so far, nothing was actually incorrectly returned.  The internal scans tend to not be too complicated, so that is an okay bet.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1905249480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc